  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="cccf4ce5-ddbb-584d-964c-05e9057710b1" activityNameId="6b022f97-07a3-5156-a5ca-1941b9b48227" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silage maize organic, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silage maize organic, at farm
Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg silage maize organic, at farm with a moisture content of 72%. Fresh matter yield/ha at 72% moisture is 49166kg.;
Synonyms: corn silage, Zea mays L.; 
UUID: 7fecb4b1-515e-3e75-a7bf-d546bd729fdd
The inventory includes the processes of soil cultivation, sowing, weed control, fertilisation, pest and pathogen control, harvest and drying of the grains. Machine infrastructure and a shed for machine sheltering is included. Inputs of fertilisers and seed as well as their transports to the farm (1km) are considered. The direct emissions on the field are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Organic production
Time period: The yield data have been collected for the years 1996-2003.
Production volume: CH prod of silage maize: 42433 ha in 2004.
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, pilot network, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services, information provided by retailers and expert knowledge. The production data were verified and adjusted by a group of experts. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7fecb4b1-515e-3e75-a7bf-d546bd729fdd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
